You call upon the very core of the world, harnessing its power to transform your body.

For [14, 16, 17, 18, 18 (TL1-5; SP 100)] turns you become a Deeprock Elemental, gaining two size categories.

This increases your Physical damage by [20%, 26%, 30%, 33%, 36% (TL1-5; SP 100)] and Physical damage penetration by [5.9%, 7.9%, 9.3%, 11%, 12% (TL1-5)], and armour by [7, 8, 9, 10, 11 (TL1-5)].

The effects increase with spellpower.
